      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6b8ad227a56787575ebbd|full_name}: yes the head tracking and blendshapes are neat! That's a pretty cool demo in the dev stream! But I'm asking for MIDI input to avatars which encompasses much more than simply the ability to implement further face tracking blendshapes. That was just one of the examples of something that could be accomplished through MIDI input.\nWith MIDI input you could do so many things. DJs could have synchronized light shows to go with their music, etc. All done through an avatar rather than rely on a world. MIDI just opens the door to many things and would make avatars much more customizable/powerful",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
