      "value": "@{5f77b41aa2a8ba19985983fb|full_name}: I think you're missing my point. The video shows VRchat is adding OSC input which will let you bring in arbitrary inputs to your avatar, which is what you're basically asking for?\nEmotiBit (wearable biometric sensor) for example outputs in OSC so you could have your avatar look tired if you physically show those symptoms.",
      "viewerReactions": null
