      "value": "@{58c6b8ad227a56787575ebbd|full_name}: ah yes, you're correct! That makes much more sense. I was reading into OSC just now and realized its potential since the video was using OSC Input on avatars. Looks like VRChat is planning on adding OSC Input to Udon at some point in the future so that's great! Thanks for linking that video!",
