  "details": "Currently, worlds allow MIDI input which gives us cool animated pianos and interactive worlds, etc. Please allow avatars to also use MIDI input. Avatars could then not only have cool instruments such as pianos, but avatars could have almost anything controlled by MIDI devices: eye-tracking, lip/face tracking, audio equalizer/visualizers, soundboards, animation triggers, heartbeat tracking, shader adjustments, etc.",
